// Ch9 B01, bark 3: Hobb, Corrow's living captain, on the strand, reading names off a slate in a flat
// voice. Overheard as Rhen walks past (it never blocks him). The names are Corrow's own, invented here.
title: ch09_bark_hobb
location: ch09/corrow_night
---
Hobb [exhausted]: Jory Sallow. Mag Sallow. Anni Tesk, nine years. #line:ch09_bark_hobb_001 #tn:"A list of the drowned, read flat off a slate. Keep the names as they are."
Hobb [exhausted]: Bren Coyle. The Coyle boys, both of them. Next row. #line:ch09_bark_hobb_002
===
